
<div class="ssn-edge-calc-input">
    <div class="form-group">
        <div>
            <span class="input-heading">SSN Edge BLAST E-value:</span>
            <span>
                {{ form_widget(form) }}
                <span>Negative log of e-value for all-by-all BLAST (&ge;1; default 5)</span>
            </span>
        </div>
        <div class="submission-error">{{ form_errors(form) }}</div>
        
        <div class="input-description">
            <p>Input an alternate e-value for BLAST to calculate similarities/edge alignment scores similarities. The
            default parameter (5) is useful for most sequences. However, a larger e-value/smaller negative log should be
            used for short sequences or when low pairwise identities may be useful for separating functionally distinct SSN
            clusters.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

